# Hilda, Power of Megalith

> Hilda is not a tank in the Tigreal sense and not a damage roamer in the Popol sense. She is a bush-positioning mark builder whose ultimate turns into an execute only after the map gives her the free real estate to stack it. Pick her when the map has bushes that matter; bench her when the game happens on open river.

