## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Invade Dire Hit (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Athena's Shield, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Immortality
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Sprint
- Blessing: Dire Hit
- Flex: Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against sustained magic poke or burn damage that keeps tagging Hilda before she can reset in a bush.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when a basic-attack marksman must hit Hilda during objective fights and chase exits.; Guardian Helmet over Athena's Shield when Use when the enemy magic threat is low and Hilda needs faster health resets between jungle invades.
- Total cost: 10970 gold

Default roam setup for invading and stacking Wilderness Mark on the enemy core. The bush-to-bush invade path keeps Force at full stacks, so Power of Wildness lands with the Dire Hit dump on top of it.

### Roam Conceal Pickoff (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Thunder Belt, Radiant Armor, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Thunder Belt, Immortality
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Athena's Shield over Radiant Armor when Use against one-rotation magic burst that can kill Hilda before bush sustain matters.; Guardian Helmet over Radiant Armor when Use when rotations are constant and Hilda is winning by re-entering fights at higher health than the enemy roam.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use against attack-speed carries that keep firing through Hilda's dive instead of relying on physical skills.
- Total cost: 10700 gold

Pickoff roam setup that trades some raw tank emblem bulk for faster rotations, Conceal windows, and Focusing Mark burst from allied follow-up.

### EXP Bruiser Execute (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Thunder Belt, War Axe, Oracle, Queen's Wings, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, War Axe, Oracle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Execute
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when crowd control or magic chip matters more than repeated physical lane trades.; Dominance Ice over Queen's Wings when Use against healing, shields, or attack-speed threats when anti-sustain matters more than low-health damage reduction.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use only from a clear lead when Hilda can reliably reach backline targets before final Lord fights.
- Total cost: 10870 gold

EXP setup for side-lane pressure where Thunder Belt and War Axe reward repeated contact before Execute closes the trade.

